00:23:44,080 --> 00:23:44,760
Chandler!
錢德勒！

250
00:23:47,100 --> 00:23:49,560
Obviously not their favorite pet.
顯然不是他們最喜歡的寵物。

251
00:23:49,620 --> 00:23:49,980
Joey!
喬伊！

252
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:52,780
May not be a bed of roses.
可能不是稱心如意。

253
00:23:53,020 --> 00:23:53,460
Rachel!
雷切爾！

254
00:23:53,780 --> 00:23:56,360
You're no friend to those with noses.
你不是那些有鼻子的人的朋友。

255
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:59,560
Ross, those are the only lines we have, sorry.
羅斯，抱歉，我們只有這些臺詞。

256
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:03,120
Okay, back to the chorus, everybody.
好的，大家回到合唱部分。

257
00:24:03,120 --> 00:24:09,480
Smelly cat, smelly cat, what are they feeding you?
臭貓，臭貓，它們給你吃什麼？

258
00:24:09,900 --> 00:24:15,900
Smelly cat, smelly cat, it's not your fault.
臭貓，臭貓，不是你的錯。

259
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:34,040
Thank you.
謝謝。

